# Force LF everywhere.
#
# This is not cosmetic. params/*.csv are the frozen query parameters, and the whole
# fairness argument is that every platform receives BYTE-IDENTICAL parameters. If git
# checked these out as CRLF on Windows and LF on Linux, two people running the same
# benchmark would be sending different bytes and any checksum comparison between their
# results would be meaningless.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.gz  binary
